#: templates/report.html.j2:193
msgid ""
"• Under CamAPS Auto Mode the loop compensates continuously; that is exactly why the loop extra\n"
"      basal is the meaningful signal. The algorithm adapts over days and can partly smooth out\n"
"      longer-standing misconfigurations."
msgstr ""
"• Under CamAPS Auto Mode the loop compensates continuously; that is exactly why the loop extra\n"
"      basal is the meaningful signal. The algorithm adapts over days and can partly smooth out\n"
"      longer-standing misconfigurations."

#: templates/report.html.j2:196
